common harvest tool~
A plain canvas roll holds an iron pick, a sturdy hatchet, a keen skinning
knife and a small sickle, each oiled and sharpened by a working hand.
Nothing about the set is remarkable, but every edge is true and every haft
is sound.

Carried or held, this tool guarantees at least common quality on successful
wilderness harvests of every kind. Only your best harvest tool applies,
tools inside containers do not count, and the tool is never consumed.
~
