uncommon harvest tool~
Oiled leather stamped with a crafting guild's mark wraps a matched set of
steel tools: a balanced pick, a felling hatchet, a flensing knife and a
curved herb sickle. Each tool sits snugly in its own loop, and all of them
were clearly made by the same careful hand.

Carried or held, this tool guarantees at least uncommon quality on
successful wilderness harvests of every kind. Only your best harvest tool
applies, tools inside containers do not count, and the tool is never
consumed.
~
