rare harvest tool~
A fitted case of dark hardwood lined with green felt holds tools edged in
bright mithril: a slender pick, a hatchet, a skinning blade and a hooked
sickle. They are astonishingly light in the hand, and their edges show no
sign of ever having dulled.

Carried or held, this tool guarantees at least rare quality on successful
wilderness harvests of every kind. Only your best harvest tool applies,
tools inside containers do not count, and the tool is never consumed.
~
