legendary harvest tool~
A case bound in dragonhide opens on tools forged from adamantine and hafted
in ironwood: a pick that bites into stone as if it were packed earth, a
hatchet, a skinning blade that parts hide along its finest grain and a
sickle that never bruises a leaf. Tiny runes of a long-forgotten artisans'
guild are etched along every haft.

Carried or held, this tool guarantees at least legendary quality on
successful wilderness harvests of every kind. Only your best harvest tool
applies, tools inside containers do not count, and the tool is never
consumed.
~
